# Vitest (Reader)

## Run

```bash
npm run lint    # tsc --noEmit
npm test        # vitest run
```

## Style

- Pure logic tests in `src/lib/__tests__/` — no DOM unless needed
- Test behavior: sync merge, conflict resolution, API parsing, storage paths
- Name: `should_<behavior>_when_<condition>`

## When to Add Tests

- Sync/position logic changes — required
- New `inpxClient` parsing — required
- UI-only changes — only if requested
